//SwiftPurse\frontend\user\send.html
-when the whole transfer form fields are filled and submitted 
-in the navbar of this page at the profile image section when clicked the sub nav profile image there should be populated with dynamic content 


-user recieves this notification below in it's dashboard notifications page
Title: Deposit Submitted
Message: Your deposit of $50(dynamic based on amount)is under review 
Time: 21 hours ago(dynamic)
icon: bell icon 
link named view details leads to the  /user/notifications.html page where all history are displayed 

and this message notifcation should also be pushed to user screen using this dynamic snipt of code according to the event that occurred

